  gs_comwa-vdate = ls_comwa-vdate.
  gs_comwa-abdat = ls_comwa-abdat.
  gs_comwa-rdate = ls_comwa-rdate.
  gs_comwa-frdat = ls_comwa-frdat.

*ENHANCEMENT-POINT CALC_DATES_PTP_02 SPOTS /BITMYM/CASE .

