METHOD create_rental_billing_plan.
*____HS# 12469, VON: STAORI, DATUM: 24.05.2018___*
*____HS# 13324, VON: STAORI, DATUM: 24.07.2019___*

ENHANCEMENT-POINT create_rental_billing_plan_01 SPOTS /bitmym/case .

* Creates debit memo after goods issue for MyM

  DATA: ls_area TYPE /sopromet/zzl01.

* Check debit memo was not created
***  CHECK gs_case-bill_plan IS INITIAL.

  /sopromet/rfc=>set_queue_combined_run( id_lrsam = gs_case-zzlrsam id_vkorg = gs_case-vkorg ).

  MOVE-CORRESPONDING gs_case TO ls_area.

*__Begin of comment ________________________________________HS 13324
*  CALL FUNCTION '/BITMYM/CREATE_BILLING_PLAN'
*    IN BACKGROUND TASK DESTINATION /sopromet/rfc=>g_rfc
*    EXPORTING
*      id_zzlrsam = gs_case-zzlrsam
*      is_area    = ls_area.
*__End of comment __________________________________________HS 13324

*__Begin of insert _________________________________________HS 13324
  CALL FUNCTION '/BITMYM/CREATE_BILLING_PLAN'
    EXPORTING
      id_zzlrsam        = gs_case-zzlrsam
      is_area           = ls_area
      id_msg_no_display = abap_false.
*__End of insert ___________________________________________HS 13324

  COMMIT WORK AND WAIT.
ENDMETHOD.


