METHOD set_prop_tc_booking.
*____HS# 013416, VON: T.Kern,    DATUM: 03.09.2019___*
*____HS# 014145, VON: RBoyapati, DATUM: 08.06.2020___*
*____HS# 014554, VON: STAORI, DATUM: 16.10.2020___*

  CHECK go_act_reservation IS BOUND.                        "HS 14554

  go_act_reservation->set_property( EXPORTING i_feld = 'GS_COMWA' i_value = gs_comwa ). "HS 14145

