METHOD reject_reservation.
*____HS# 9954,  VON: S.Taori, DATUM: 02.06.2014 ___*
*____HS# 12481, VON: S.Taori, DATUM: 27.04.2018 ___*

ENHANCEMENT-POINT reject_reservation_01 SPOTS /bitmym/case.

  fill_go_main_2006( ).
  go_main_2006->g_screen->exe_reject_sets_collect( ).

*__If last reservation(s) is/are being cancelled and all other reservations of the case
*  are complete, then we set the flag 'UNUSED' in case table
  check_if_case_is_unused( ).                               "HS 12481
