  METHOD create_transfer_request.
*____HS# 013526, VON: RBoyapati, DATUM: 07.11.2019___*

    DATA: ls_res TYPE /sopromet/zzlrv.

    CHECK go_appl IS BOUND.

    CHECK go_partner IS BOUND.

*__Step 1: Set partners
    set_property go_partner 'GT_VBPA' it_vbpa.
    set_property go_partner 'GD_CHANGE_FLAG' abap_true .
    partner_selection( id_no_dialog = abap_true id_suppress_mess = abap_true ).
    new_reservation_fill_partner_d( CHANGING cs_comwa = gs_comwa ).

*___Step 2: Init for a new case
    CREATE OBJECT go_act_reservation.
    create_new_case( ).
    MOVE-CORRESPONDING gs_comwa TO ls_res.
    set_property go_act_reservation 'G_RESERVATION' ls_res.

*___Step 3: Build Tree
    ui5_prep_reservation_tree( i_add_res = abap_true ).

*___Step 4: Set Text
    ui5_prep_booking_notes( it_notes = it_notes ).

*___Step 5: Post Transfer Request
    CHECK ui5_post_booking( ) EQ abap_true.

*___Step 10: Fill Return Daten
*    ui5_booking_result( EXPORTING is_data_ui5 = ls_data_ui5 IMPORTING es_data = es_data ).


  ENDMETHOD.


