  METHOD ui5_s4h_simulate_reservation.
*___ SR1-1673, User: OOGUR, Date: 15.09.2023___*

    DATA:lo_case  TYPE REF TO /bitmym/cl_case.

    lo_case = /bitmym/cl_case=>create( id_case = i_zzlrsam io_ui5 = io_ui5 ).
    CHECK lo_case IS BOUND.
    lo_case->ui5_s4h_simulate_res_int( EXPORTING  io_case = lo_case
