  METHOD set_data.
*___ SR2-340, User: STEKDEMIR, Date: 11.04.2024___*
*___ SR2-54, User: SBADUSHA, Date: 26.06.2024___*
*___ SR2-718, User: STEKDEMIR, Date: 15.10.2024___*
*___ SR2-1452, User: SCOSAR, Date: 28.01.2025___*

    LOOP AT it_fields ASSIGNING FIELD-SYMBOL(<fields>).
      ASSIGN COMPONENT <fields>-fieldname OF STRUCTURE is_data TO FIELD-SYMBOL(<data>).
      ASSIGN (<fields>-fieldname) TO FIELD-SYMBOL(<ls_data>).
      CHECK <data> IS ASSIGNED AND <ls_data> IS ASSIGNED.
      <ls_data> = <data>.
    ENDLOOP.
    IF sy-subrc <> 0.
      go_ui5                   = is_data-go_ui5.
      go_appl                  = is_data-go_appl.
      go_act_reservation       = is_data-go_act_reservation.
      go_partner               = is_data-go_partner.
      go_salesarea             = is_data-go_salesarea.
      go_tree_case             = is_data-go_tree_case.
      go_rstyp                 = is_data-go_rstyp.                  "SR2-1452
      gt_reservations          = is_data-gt_reservations.
      gs_actual_area           = is_data-gs_actual_area.
      gs_case                  = is_data-gs_case.
      gs_case_yy               = is_data-gs_case_yy.
      gs_comwa                 = is_data-gs_comwa.
      gd_case                  = is_data-gd_case.
      gd_reservation           = is_data-gd_reservation.
      gd_dependent_combinedrun = is_data-gd_dependent_combinedrun.  "SR2-718
      gd_dependent_rscat       = is_data-gd_dependent_rscat      .  "SR2-718
      gd_dependent_reservation = is_data-gd_dependent_reservation.  "SR2-718
*      gd_rap_framework   = is_data-gd_rap_framework.   "SR2-54 DEL
    ENDIF.

  ENDMETHOD.


  METHOD ui5_get_dispatch_pgi_data.
*___ SR2-233, User: SBADUSHA, Date: 14.03.2024___*

    DATA : ls_likp TYPE likpvb.



    ""Date Format should be '00000000' as wadat_ist is space here , so to avoid dump clearing space for all entires.
    LOOP AT ct_entity ASSIGNING FIELD-SYMBOL(<fs_entity>) WHERE wadat_ist = space.
      CLEAR <fs_entity>-wadat_ist.
    ENDLOOP.

    LOOP AT ct_entity ASSIGNING <fs_entity>
                               WHERE vgart = /sopromet/cl_l_reservation=>c_vgart_wa.

*      CLEAR <fs_entity>-wadat_ist.
*      DATA(ls_zzlaa) = /sopromet/cl_l_order_type=>get_process_type(
*                              i_vorgangsart = /sopromet/cl_l_reservation=>c_vgart_wa
*                              id_vkorg      = <fs_entity>-vkorg
*                              i_no_message  = abap_true ).

*      CHECK  ls_zzlaa-vgart EQ <fs_entity>-vgart.

      IF <fs_entity>-vbeln_vl IS NOT INITIAL.
        CALL FUNCTION 'SHP_LIKP_GET_SINGLE'
          EXPORTING
            if_vbeln        = <fs_entity>-vbeln_vl
          CHANGING
            cs_likp         = ls_likp
          EXCEPTIONS
            no_record_found = 1
            OTHERS          = 2.
        IF sy-subrc = 0.
          <fs_entity>-wadat_ist = ls_likp-wadat_ist.
        ENDIF.
      ENDIF.

    ENDLOOP.
  ENDMETHOD.


